# Keeps the test-fixtures/ directory in the repo. Drop as many local
# test images here as you need — every file in this dir is gitignored
# (private/large binaries), and only this .gitkeep is tracked, so the
# directory stays versioned without committing any image contents.
#
# The browser probes in scripts/*.mjs currently expect IMG_1804.jpg;
# regenerate one locally, e.g.:
#   sips -s format jpeg public/screenshots/iPhone.png --out test-fixtures/IMG_1804.jpg
